    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/651651445132.JPG\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 90px;\" /><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">πRL</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></math>= Slant height<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"italic\"> dQ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">σ</mi><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">πr</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">dx</mi></math><br /><br />= Charge on the elementary ring<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">dQ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">πRL</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">πrdx</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">LR</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">rdx</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ... (1)<br /><br />By similarity of triangles :<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"italic\"> </mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mi></math> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ... (2)<br /><br />By (1) and (2) we get<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">dQ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">LR</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">xdx </mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">xdx</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴ &nbsp; </mo></math>&nbsp;the electric potential at A due to ring is<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">dV</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">kdQ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">xdx</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴ &nbsp; </mo></math> Total potential at A is<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">dv</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">kQ</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">dx</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">kQ</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">kQ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴ &nbsp; </mo></math> Work done to shift a charge q from infinity to point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">A</mi></math> is = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>qV</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">kqQ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"italic\"> </mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">π</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">ϵ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">qQ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">qQ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">π</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">ϵ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
